  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Children of Incarcerated Parents Thrive</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">105,000 children in New York are impacted by parental incarceration, threatening their developmental well-being. In response, partnering with organizations like Children of Promise, MindLeaps works with system-impacted children in Brooklyn and the Bronx, to develop social-emotional and cognitive skills to increase emotional resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
